  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"x-section\" id=\"x-section-1\"><div class=\"x-container max width\" id=\"\"><div class=\"x-column x-sm x-1-1\"><div class=\"x-text\" id=\"\"><p>Sebastian Gronbach and I recently had a series of dialogues at the <a href=\"http://anahata-akademie.de/\">Anahata Akademie</a>, Sebastian’s ashram near Bonn in Germany.</p><p>Sebastian was interested in some things I had said in a recent exchange with Deepak Chopra. At the end of my impromptu talk with Deepak, I expressed three wishes for the future: I said that I wanted to be free, to burn Karma, and to make the world a better place.</p><p>In these seven short videos, Sebastian and I go deeper into those wishes. We also touch on additional subjects, including Sebastian’s awakening to evolution, my relationship with my own Guru Poonjaji, and what it means to awaken to the truth of suffering.</p></div><hr class=\"x-hr\"/><hr class=\"x-gap\"/><h2 class=\"h-custom-headline cs-ta-center mtn h4\"><span>Part 1: Freedom</span></h2><div class=\"x-video embed\"><div class=\"x-video-inner\"><div class=\"embed-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"about:blank\"></iframe></div></div></div><hr class=\"x-gap\"/><h2 class=\"h-custom-headline cs-ta-center mtn h4\"><span>Part 2: Burning Karma</span></h2><div class=\"x-video embed\"><div class=\"x-video-inner\"><div class=\"embed-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"about:blank\"></iframe></div></div></div><hr class=\"x-gap\"/><h2 class=\"h-custom-headline cs-ta-center mtn h4\"><span>Part 3: What is the Unique Self of Andrew Cohen?</span></h2><div class=\"x-video embed\"><div class=\"x-video-inner\"><div class=\"embed-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"about:blank\"></iframe></div></div></div><hr class=\"x-gap\"/><h2 class=\"h-custom-headline cs-ta-center mtn h4\"><span>Part 4: Awakening to Becoming</span></h2><div class=\"x-video embed\"><div class=\"x-video-inner\"><div class=\"embed-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"about:blank\"></iframe></div></div></div><hr class=\"x-gap\"/><h2 class=\"h-custom-headline cs-ta-center mtn h4\"><span>Part 5: Poonjaji</span></h2><div class=\"x-video embed\"><div class=\"x-video-inner\"><div class=\"embed-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"about:blank\"></iframe></div></div></div><hr class=\"x-gap\"/><h2 class=\"h-custom-headline cs-ta-center mtn h4\"><span>Part 6: Making the World a Better Place</span></h2><div class=\"x-video embed\"><div class=\"x-video-inner\"><div class=\"embed-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"about:blank\"></iframe></div></div></div><hr class=\"x-gap\"/><h2 class=\"h-custom-headline cs-ta-center mtn h4\"><span>Part 7: Awakening to the Truth of Suffering</span></h2><div class=\"x-video embed\"><div class=\"x-video-inner\"><div class=\"embed-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"about:blank\"></iframe></div></div></div></div></div></div>",
